---
// ValueProps.astro — Diferenciadores reales vs competencia chilena de RAEE
// BLOQUE 4: Elevado con diseño moderno, animaciones y glassmorphism
---

<section id="por-que" class="relative w-full py-32 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900">
  <!-- Background accent elements -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-500/30 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-20">
      <div class="inline-block mb-4">
        <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase px-4 py-2 rounded-full"
          style="background: rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.1); color: #FB923C;">
          Diferenciadores clave
        </span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        ¿Por qué <span class="text-amber-500">ElectroLoop</span>?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        No somos un gestor más. Somos el único especialista exclusivo en RAEE con trazabilidad auditable y destrucción de datos certificada en Chile.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cards Grid with staggered animation -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8">

      <!-- Card 1: 100% especializado -->
      <div class="group relative h-full" data-scroll-animate="fade-up">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/20 to-orange-500/10 rounded-2xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <div class="relative bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-700/50 rounded-2xl p-8 h-full flex flex-col hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
          <div class="mb-6">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/20 to-orange-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-amber-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M9 3H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v4m6-6h10a2 2 0 012 2v4M9 3v18m0 0h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M9 21H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4m0 0h18" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="inline-block">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400">
                Especialización
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">100% enfocados en RAEE</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed flex-grow">
            No gestionamos residuos industriales genéricos. ElectroLoop existe exclusivamente para reciclaje electrónico. Eso se nota en cada proceso.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400">Diferenciadorpor:</span> Expertise 100% RAEE
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Destrucción de datos -->
      <div class="group relative h-full" data-scroll-animate="fade-up">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/20 to-orange-500/10 rounded-2xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <div class="relative bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-700/50 rounded-2xl p-8 h-full flex flex-col hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
          <div class="mb-6">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/20 to-orange-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-amber-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="inline-block">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400">
                Certificado
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Destrucción de datos certificada</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed flex-grow">
            Borrado seguro o destrucción física certificada por dispositivo. Válido para auditorías e informes de cumplimiento normativo.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400">Diferenciador por:</span> Certificación por serie
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Trazabilidad -->
      <div class="group relative h-full" data-scroll-animate="fade-up">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/20 to-orange-500/10 rounded-2xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <div class="relative bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-700/50 rounded-2xl p-8 h-full flex flex-col hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
          <div class="mb-6">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/20 to-orange-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-amber-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h2M3 17v2a2 2 0 002 2h2M17 3h2a2 2 0 012 2v2M17 21h2a2 2 0 002-2v-2M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="inline-block">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400">
                Auditable
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Trazabilidad auditable en tiempo real</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed flex-grow">
            Seguimiento digital de cada componente en tiempo real, con reportes descargables para auditoría REP e informe ESG.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400">Diferenciador por:</span> Transparencia total
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Socio REP -->
      <div class="group relative h-full" data-scroll-animate="fade-up">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/20 to-orange-500/10 rounded-2xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <div class="relative bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-700/50 rounded-2xl p-8 h-full flex flex-col hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
          <div class="mb-6">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/20 to-orange-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-amber-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="inline-block">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400">
                Partnership
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Socio REP, no solo proveedor</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed flex-grow">
            Gestionamos tu obligación REP de principio a fin: registro, reportería y auditorías incluidas. Tú te concentras en tu negocio.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400">Diferenciador por:</span> Relación estratégica
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .group:hover .group-hover\:scale-110 {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
